@startuml
title GetDevices - vollständiger Ablauf von Integration bis Client

autonumber
hide footbox

box "Integration SDK"
participant DeviceIntegrationHostFactory as HostFactory
participant DeviceIntegrationHost as Host
participant IntegrationWorkerSupervisor as Supervisor
participant DeviceIntegrationWorker as Worker
participant "WorkerServiceProxy\n(Integration.Contracts)" as WorkerProxy
participant IDeviceIntegration as Integration
end box

box "DeviceIntegrationPlugin"
participant DeviceIntegrationWorkerService as WorkerService
participant "StreamTrackingJobTransmitter\n<GetDevices>" as TrackingTx
participant "JobTransmitter\n<GetDevices>" as InnerTx
participant StreamTrackerCoordinator as Coordinator
participant ServiceStreamTracker as Tracker
participant ServiceDirectory as Directory
participant IntegrationDeviceCatalogSynchronizer as Synchronizer
participant JobFacade as Facade
participant IntegrationDeviceCatalog as Catalog
participant DeviceIntegrationService as ClientService
end box

box "Client.Contracts"
participant DeviceIntegrationServiceProxy as ClientProxy
end box

actor Client

group 1. SDK zusammensetzen und starten
  HostFactory -> Host : Create(service, integration, ...)
  Host -> Supervisor : RunService(service, token)
  Supervisor -> Worker : für jeden verpflichtenden Endpoint starten
end

group 2. GetDevices-Stream öffnen und tracken
  Worker -> WorkerProxy : ListenForGetDevicesRequests(service)
  WorkerProxy -> WorkerService : gRPC-Stream öffnen
  WorkerService -> TrackingTx : GetRequestStream(service, token)
  TrackingTx -> InnerTx : GetRequestStream(service, token)
  InnerTx --> TrackingTx : IAsyncEnumerable<JobRequest<EmptyDto>>
  TrackingTx -> Coordinator : TrackStream(service, GetDevices, requestStream)
  Coordinator -> Tracker : GetOrCreate(service) und TrackStream(...)
  Tracker --> WorkerService : TrackedStream (über Coordinator/Decorator)
  WorkerService --> WorkerProxy : gRPC-Nachrichtenstrom
  WorkerProxy --> Worker : Stream
  Worker -> Worker : Stream lesen
  Tracker -> Tracker : GetDevices = Active
end

group 3. Service wird verfügbar und Initialsnapshot wird geladen
  note over Tracker
    In der aktuellen GetDevices-Ausbaustufe ist GetDevices
    der verpflichtende Endpoint. Später müssen alle
    definierten Methodenstreams Active sein.
  end note
  Tracker -> Coordinator : Availability = true
  Coordinator -> Directory : RegisterService(service)
  Coordinator -> Synchronizer : ServiceAvailable(service)
  Synchronizer -> Facade : GetDevices für service
  Facade -> TrackingTx : TransmitJobAndWaitForResult(...)
  TrackingTx -> InnerTx : delegieren
  InnerTx --> WorkerService : Request im geöffneten Stream
  WorkerService --> WorkerProxy : gRPC-Nachricht
  WorkerProxy --> Worker : JobRequest<EmptyDto>
  Worker -> Integration : GetDevices(token)
  Integration --> Worker : IntegrationDeviceDto[]
  Worker -> WorkerProxy : SendGetDevicesResult(result)
  WorkerProxy -> WorkerService : unary gRPC-Aufruf
  WorkerService -> TrackingTx : NotifyJobResult(result)
  TrackingTx -> InnerTx : delegieren
  InnerTx --> Facade : korreliertes Ergebnis
  Facade --> Synchronizer : devices
  Synchronizer -> Catalog : PublishDeviceSnapshot(service, devices)
end

group 4. Client liest den veröffentlichten Katalog
  Client -> ClientProxy : GetDevices()
  ClientProxy -> ClientService : gRPC-Aufruf
  ClientService -> Catalog : GetAvailableDevices()
  Catalog --> ClientService : devices aller verfügbaren Services
  ClientService --> ClientProxy : devices
  ClientProxy --> Client : devices
end

group 5. Ein Pflichtstream endet
  WorkerProxy --> Worker : Stream endet / Fehler
  Tracker -> Tracker : Endpoint erhält terminalen Zustand
  Tracker -> Tracker : Availability = false und alle Streams beenden
  Tracker -> Coordinator : Availability = false
  Coordinator -> Directory : UnregisterService(service)
  Coordinator -> Synchronizer : ServiceUnavailable(service)
  Synchronizer -> Catalog : RemoveServiceDevices(service)
  Worker --> Supervisor : Worker-Task endet
  Supervisor -> Supervisor : übrige Worker abbrechen
  Supervisor --> Host : Service-Lauf beendet
  Host -> Supervisor : nach Verzögerung neu starten
end

note over TrackingTx,Tracker
  Das IAsyncEnumerable<T> ist der technische Stream und wird
  direkt von TrackedStream<T> dekoriert. Eine zusätzliche
  Stream<T>-Klasse wird nicht eingeführt.
end note
@enduml
